Bumps the uv group with 3 updates in the /src/git directory: [gitpython](https://github.com/gitpython-developers/GitPython), [mcp](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk) and [pydantic-settings](https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-settings).
